{"type":"statement","design":"","title":"ZoomInfo powers modern B2B enterprise intelligence","lead":"Over 35,000 businesses rely on ZoomInfo for governed, real-time commercial intelligence.","statement":"ZoomInfo orchestrates mission-critical commercial data for over 35,000 enterprise businesses.","text":"By integrating directly with Google Cloud, ZoomInfo distributes commercial Data Cubes via BigQuery Analytics Hub without physical copies, enabling native machine learning and geospatial analysis on published B2B datasets.","points":[{"title":"","text":"ZoomInfo plays a foundational role in B2B go-to-market orchestration across more than 35,000 businesses, enabling revenue teams to identify ideal buyers and accelerate pipeline generation."},{"title":"","text":"Through its partnership with Google Cloud, ZoomInfo delivers commercial intelligence directly through BigQuery Analytics Hub using zero-copy data sharing."},{"title":"","text":"This architecture allows customers to run native BigQuery ML and geospatial analytics directly on published B2B datasets without external egress, substantially reducing processing latency and cloud infrastructure costs."}],"notes":"ZoomInfo plays a foundational role in B2B go-to-market orchestration across more than 35,000 businesses. Through its partnership with Google Cloud, ZoomInfo delivers commercial intelligence directly through BigQuery Analytics Hub using zero-copy data sharing. This architecture allows customers to run native BigQuery ML and geospatial analytics directly on published B2B datasets without external egress.

